knixx-vl53l7cx is a port of parts of STMicroelectronics' VL53L7CX ultra lite
driver (ULD) 2.0.1, which is vendored in VL53L7CX_ULD_driver_2.0.1/, and
firmware/ holds the sensor firmware and default settings extracted from its
vl53l7cx_buffers.h by cargo xtask genfw. testdata/harness runs the C driver on the host to record
testdata/configure.golden.

